{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy a deep chess experience \u2013 solo or online \u2013 with Just Chess!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned player, Just Chess has everything you need. Sharpen your skills against a smart AI in a modern 3D environment, or challenge the world with the new Lichess integration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in Chess Engine</strong> \u2013 Play offline instantly using the game's internal chess engine, no setup required.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UCI Engine Support</strong> \u2013 You can connect an external chess engine that supports the UCI protocol, such as Stockfish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lichess Support</strong> \u2013 Log in to your  account directly from the game! Challenge your friends or millions of other players online, play against Lichess's Stockfish AI, or continue your ongoing games. All your online games are seamlessly synchronized. (<i>Note: Currently supports Standard chess and games with a base time of 10 minutes or longer.</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Chessboard</strong> \u2013 With an adjustable viewing angle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flip &amp; Reset View</strong> \u2013 Use F to flip the board and R to reset it to your playing side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess Clocks &amp; Time Controls</strong> \u2013 Play timed games with popular formats like Bullet (1+0), Blitz (5+3), Rapid (10+5), and Classical (30+0, 90/40). Time controls under 10 minutes are supported with both the built-in and UCI chess engines. Untimed mode is also available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2D and 3D Chess Clocks</strong> \u2013 Switch between practical 2D and immersive 3D clock views using the C key. 3D clocks show remaining time as a circular diagram.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable Move Speed</strong> \u2013 Customize how fast the built-in or UCI chess engine plays its moves for a more relaxed or time-pressured experience. Combine with difficulty settings for a personalized challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Play</strong> \u2013 Simple controls and an intuitive interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive AI Strength</strong> \u2013 The AI automatically adjusts its strength based on your wins and losses, ensuring a balanced challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PGN Export and Analysis</strong> \u2013 The game allows you to copy the chess game in PGN format to the clipboard and analyze it on online chess analysis websites. Online analysis may require an account with the analysis service provider.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 Steam Achievements</strong> \u2013 Unlock achievements as you play and test your skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: External chess engines must be downloaded separately. Please use only trusted sources. The developer is not responsible for third-party software.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawn Promoter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/966e9a9d01085b2e4d8cb47db68671f5a2b7f465.jpg"},{"name":"At least the pieces don't fall off the board!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/5af6c54e76105faa8716444a71e498072a81b8c1.jpg"},{"name":"Pawn's First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/25362bb65b3702683dad6f8da11e0b5b2ea16295.jpg"},{"name":"Castling Commander","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2242080/1ea6d30181daf685aa69bc8e71e56f2e9f685012.jpg"},{"name":"Knight Rider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.c